{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Bikini Warriors OVA","The first episode will focus on Hunter and Valkyrie, who were guest characters in the television anime, as well as two new characters: Cleric and Kunoichi. Hunter and Valkyrie meet Cleric and think she will join them as their healer, but something is strange about her. Then they are attacked by Kunoichi, who seeks legendary bikini armor.\n\n\n\nThe second episode will focus on Fighter's party after they have overcome hardships, spoken with god, and earned the legendary bikini armor. However, the armor is invisible to idiots.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["ビキニ・ウォリアーズ",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":31283,"relation":"prequel"}],"id":"mal-33712","ids":{"shikimori":33712,"mal":33712,"anilist":87480,"kodik":"serial-28986"},"kodikIds":["serial-28986"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-28986":"2020-08-25T08:00:01Z"},"title":"Бикини-воины OVA","originalTitle":"Bikini Warriors OVA","alt":"ビキニ・ウォリアーズ OVA Bikini Warriors OVA ビキニ・ウォリアーズ","description":"Новые OVA выйдут осенью 2016 года. В них появятся два новых персонажа — Клерик и Куноити.","year":2016,"type":"OVA","genres":["Комедия","Фэнтези","этти","пародия"],"rating":5.54,"popularity":6382,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[31283],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/33712/19a2844920507072c1b87e2ff35f08d8.jpeg","width":420,"height":595},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/2eae38d96ac80dc297a5dcc37b6025af40bef15d.jpg","width":1280,"height":720}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-1185","dubId":"1185","label":"Tina","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-28986","translationId":"1185","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/711300/508e1783282aaebd57ec93f2810821a9/720p","se